 "name": "ladder_L4",
 "doc": "4L ladder calibration family (Usyukina-Davydychev Phi^(1..4)). Chart (a,b)=(w,wbar) independent; Euclidean slice b=conj(a). u=a*b/((a-1)*(b-1)), v=1/((a-1)*(b-1)). Branch loci in chart = letter zeros {a=0, a=1, b=0, b=1}; kinematic-space loci u=0 (a=0 or b=0 sheet-locus), v=0 (chart infinity), lambda=0 (a=b; NOT a DE singularity \u2014 prefactor pole only, cancels in Phi). ORIENTATION LAW (frame stamp, receipt gate_ladder.py matches): frame ladder integral = -(1/u) * Phi^(L)(1/u, v/u).",
